  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support towards institutionalising the Public Private Partnership policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic support to Infrastructure Finance Secretariat in monitoring and supporting implementation of the National Infrastructure Pipeline and help ideate on the future of infrastructure development pathways beyond 2025, &#x2022; Supporting IFS&#x2019;s role as a strategic advisor for India&#x2019;s Presidency of the G20, specifically on matters related to infrastructure and infrastructure finance, &#x2022; Supporting enhancement of institutional capacity of States for upscaling infrastructure investments &#x2022; Strengthening the policy framework for infrastructure investments, including through climate finance and private investment</narrative>
  </description>
